        {"type": "text", "x": 600, "y": 416, "text": "外设就绪后才配置 PWM 输出", "size": 15, "color": "orange"},

        {"type": "box", "x": 50, "y": 470, "w": 290, "h": 116, "pad": 14,
         "rich": [
           {"text": "11  TIM9 PWM 初始化", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 19, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "TIM9_CH2_PWM_Init", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "text"},
           {"text": "(255, 1)", "font": "mono", "size": 15, "color": "text"}
         ]},
        {"type": "box", "x": 375, "y": 470, "w": 290, "h": 116, "pad": 14,
         "rich": [
           {"text": "12  初值 0", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 20, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "TIM_SetTIM9Compare2", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "text"},
           {"text": "(0) → CCR2 = 0", "font": "mono", "size": 15, "color": "text"}
         ]},
        {"type": "box", "x": 700, "y": 470, "w": 290, "h": 116, "pad": 14, "stroke": "green", "fill": "#F4FBF7",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "13  while(1)", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 20, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "KEY_Scan / delay_ms(10)", "font": "mono", "size": 13, "color": "text"},
           {"text": "改 CCR2 → 改电压", "font": "msyh", "size": 15, "color": "green"}
         ]},

        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[340, 528], [375, 528]], "color": "dark", "width": 4},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[665, 528], [700, 528]], "color": "dark", "width": 4},

        {"type": "note", "x": 1060, "y": 480, "w": 580, "size": 17,
         "text": "PA3 输出 351.5625 kHz 方波，占空比 = CCR2/256；经二阶 RC 取平均后得到 0~3.3 V 直流，再由 PA5 的 ADC1_CH5 回读显示。"}
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "pwm-clock",
      "size": [1700, 1110],
      "bg": "#ffffff",
      "elements": [
        {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 34, "text": "TIM9 时钟链：25 MHz 晶振 → 351.5625 kHz PWM", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 30, "color": "dark"},
        {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 82, "text": "每一级都写出算式；PSC 与 ARR 各分频一次，别把 PCLK2 当成定时器时钟", "size": 18, "color": "muted"},

        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 120, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "01  HSE 外部晶振 = 25 MHz", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "stm32f4xx_hal_conf.h : HSE_VALUE = 25000000", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "muted"}
         ]},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[850, 210], [850, 232]], "color": "primary", "width": 4, "head": 12},
        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 232, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "02  PLL1：M=25 先分频，N=360 再倍频", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "25 MHz / 25 * 360 = 360 MHz (VCO)", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "muted"}
         ]},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[850, 322], [850, 344]], "color": "primary", "width": 4, "head": 12},
        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 344, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "03  PLLP=2：系统时钟 SYSCLK", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "SYSCLK = 360 MHz / 2 = 180 MHz", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "muted"}
         ]},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[850, 434], [850, 456]], "color": "primary", "width": 4, "head": 12},
        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 456, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "04  AHB /1 → HCLK；APB1 /4 → PCLK1", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "HCLK = 180 MHz / PCLK1 = 45 MHz", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "muted"}
         ]},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[850, 546], [850, 568]], "color": "primary", "width": 4, "head": 12},
        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 568, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "05  APB2 /2 → PCLK2", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "PCLK2 = 180 MHz / 2 = 90 MHz", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "muted"}
         ]},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[850, 658], [850, 680]], "color": "primary", "width": 4, "head": 12},
        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 680, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "06  APB2 定时器时钟 = PCLK2 x 2", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "TIM9CLK = 90 MHz * 2 = 180 MHz", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "muted"}
         ]},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[850, 770], [850, 792]], "color": "primary", "width": 4, "head": 12},
        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 792, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "07  TIM9 PSC=1：计数器时钟再除 2", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "CK_CNT = 180 MHz / (1+1) = 90 MHz", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "muted"}
         ]},
        {"type": "arrow", "points": [[850, 882], [850, 904]], "color": "primary", "width": 4, "head": 12},
        {"type": "box", "x": 90, "y": 904, "w": 1520, "h": 90, "pad": 12, "align": "left", "stroke": "green", "fill": "#F4FBF7",
         "rich": [
           {"text": "08  ARR=255：PWM 频率 = CK_CNT / 256", "font": "msyhbd", "size": 21, "color": "dark"},
           {"text": "Fpwm = 90 MHz / 256 = 351.5625 kHz", "font": "mono", "size": 14, "color": "green"}
         ]},

        {"type": "note", "x": 90, "y": 1016, "w": 1520, "size": 17,
         "text": "易错点：main.c 注释写 Fpwm=90M/256，把 PCLK2 当成了定时器时钟；实际 TIM9CLK=180 MHz，先被 PSC=1 二分频、再被 ARR+1 分频，结果同为 351.5625 kHz。"}
      ]
    },

